            <title>[LU-19933] sanity test_160h 12MDT: 'mds9: User cl11 still registered'</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19933</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@dilger.ca&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/ca00dda0-f6b3-4013-ba00-21fc68b7549a" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/ca00dda0-f6b3-4013-ba00-21fc68b7549a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_160h failed with the following error when running a custom test session with 12 MDTs:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/56384" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/56384&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-14058" title="Create tests for large number of MDTs" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-14058"&gt;LU-14058&lt;/a&gt; tests: clean up sanity.sh MDT name generation")&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;mds9: User cl11 still registered
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/121937" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/121937&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.89.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/121937" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/121937&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.89.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It always fails on facet mds9, though the logs show all of the changelog users are properly configured. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I couldn't find anywhere obvious where &lt;tt&gt;MDT000$idx&lt;/tt&gt; or similar was used, so possibly in the &lt;tt&gt;changelog_register&lt;/tt&gt; or &lt;tt&gt;${facet}_svc&lt;/tt&gt; handling code?  Disable for now, so that the remaining fixes can be landed.&lt;/p&gt;







&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
sanity test_160h - mds9: User cl11 still registered&lt;/p&gt;</description>
